#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:23
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&sonnet; provides a &GUI; frontend to various free spell checkers, allowing "
"spell-checking to be easily integrated into Qt-based applications."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have &systemsettings; installed, the <ulink url=\"help:kcontrol/"
"spellchecking\">Spell Checker</ulink> module can be used to control the "
"behaviour of the &sonnet;, including the default language to use."
msgstr ""

